# M8 headless online test, the hosting machine with the full game (lobby,
# match, winner screen, back to the lobby). Run by scripts/net/gui-online.sh,
# which starts this as `bopl-port --headless --warpzone-host --drive ...` and
# lets two headless peers (`--net-peer`, 4 bot players each) join the room.
# Syntax: crates/game/src/driver.rs.
0 wait charsel
30 press pad0 accept            # four local players join the lobby
6 press pad1 accept
6 press pad2 accept
6 press km accept
10 press pad1 right             # pad1: team 1
8 press km down
8 press km down
8 press km down
8 press km down
8 press km right                # km: next colour
20 shot 01-lobby-local
8 press km down
8 press km accept               # km ready
4 press pad0 start
4 press pad1 start
4 press pad2 start
0 wait machines 3
150 shot 02-lobby-full
8 press pad0 start              # host: start!
0 wait match
0 bot km
0 bot pad0
0 bot pad1
0 bot pad2
60 shot 03-flyin
0 wait round
150 shot 04-round
0 wait winner
20 shot 05-winner
8 press pad0 select             # back to character select: ends the session
0 wait charsel
90 shot 06-lobby-back
5 quit
